{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27155","headline":"送灵溪李侍郎 · 郑巢","name":"送灵溪李侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"貂裘离阙下，初佐汉元勳。\n河偃流澌叠，沙晴远树分。\n牛羊下暮霭，鼓角调寒云。\n中夕萧关宿，边声不可闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑巢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}